    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100759" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοδ-ίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ</span>,
